{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Q70BXSiqQK1794823185.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產信德中心分行副分區營業經理吳炳朝表示，分行新近促成西營盤翰林峰買賣成交，單位為5座高層B室，實用面積215平方呎，採開放式設計，向東南，享部分海景。單位早前以700萬元放售，最新以680萬元成交，折合實用呎價31,628元。<br/>據了解，新買家為用家。原業主於2025年以530萬元購入單位，持貨1年，是次轉手賬面獲利150萬元，單位升值28%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:09.080576+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T09:59:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:45:57.789353+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T11:11:33.857021+00:00","content_hash":"335f62aa6e757b15026970df6974c328a4af434897ef79c41899bfef8ca709ca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T11:18:09.080576+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}